{"ref":"BDB, יְהוֹיָקִים","hw":"יְהוֹיָקִים","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹיָקִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹיָקִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹקִים</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> 𝔊 Ἰωακειμ <strong>(</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>raiseth up;</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֶלְיָקִים\" href=\"/BDB,_אֶלְיָקִים\", dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְיָקִים</a> & reff.; also <span dir=\"rtl\">יָקִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְקַמְיָה</span><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> one of the last kings of Judah, son of Josiah <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:34\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.34\">2 K 23:34</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:35\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:36\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.1\">24:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:5\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.15\">1 Ch 3:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.16\">16</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.4\">2 Ch 36:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.3\">Je 1:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.18\">22:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 24:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.24.1\">24:1</a> + 19 times Je, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:1\" href=\"/Daniel.1.1\">Dn 1:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:2\" href=\"/Daniel.1.2\">2</a>; name changed from orig. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְיָקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:24\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.24\">2 K 23:34</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.4\">2 Ch 36:4</a>.<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹיָקִים</span> priest, son of Jeshua <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.10\">Ne 12:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.26\">26</a>.<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹקִים</span> a Judaite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.22\">1 Ch 4:22</a>.","next":"BDB, יְהוֹיָרִיב","prev":"BDB, יְהוֹיָכִין"}